Subject: [PATCH 16/16 RFC] media: meson: decouple Meson8b decode slots from capture buffers

Port the runtime independent frame pool and its lifetime ordering to
Linux 7.3.4. Retain syscon register access and genpd/runtime PM. The
stream determines DMA slots; userspace CAPTURE buffers only hold the
converted display copy. H.264 validates geometry and uses reference
count plus two slots. This is compile-level research, not new board
hardware acceptance.

---
